# CMDEDIT-SEL-09: copy e 20, 5 7, ne 3 4, to 100 100, 10.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/tiny -noprompt
load a
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
box 0 0 10 10
select area metal1
copy e 20
box values
copy 5 7
box values
copy ne 3 4
box values
copy to 100 100
box values
copy 10
box values
save a
